Z||000021||fldevel||11-27-2000||11:37 PM|||| oh ive decieved you all .. i own an mr2 .. well actualy my sister does now .. i used it as my every day beet up car so i dident mess up my fieros  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> it is a decent car .. well it still runs after all its been through wich is a plus , but .. its just not a fiero ..and whare does this guy get off saying that an mr2 handles better than a fiero ?? lmao .. not even close .. the mr2 has too much body roll wich makes it a lil slippery on my set road course "backroads"<P><BR>slides out @ mph over back roads:<P>my 85 fiero 2m4 w/stock suspention = ~55mph i notice a lil front end push " with old bald tires on front"<P>my 85 GT= ~ 65mph .. safely anyway .. <P>my mr2 = ~50 mph the rear end gets really squirly  <P>note: these tests where done with a passenger to prove a point to him .. fieros are better ||||reg||1
