Z||000055||RaeQwan||11-28-2000||07:09 PM||||1FST2M6, seriously man... you ought to donate that car to me <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I got a 88 4banger I'll trade ya hehe  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I plain out love your car. Love mine too, and love its 4banger.. thats why I plan on stickin with it and building it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Speed aint the best thing in the world, its all about looks, and to keep this on subject with the mr2's.. I'd take a 86-88GT or 87-88coupe/formula Fiero anyday over ANY Mr2. <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/raeqwancfa.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000056||MR2 Fan||11-28-2000||10:58 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Black88GT:<BR><B>To the MR2 fan, Fiero's were recalled all years, yes, but NOT for engine fires. <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually they were recalled for ALL years for engine fires...<P>Bulletins for 1984 Pontiac Fiero 4-151 2.5L<P>                                          Safety Recalls<P>     TSB Number   Issue Date  TSB Title<BR>  1. 88C23          JUN 90       Potential For Engine Fires <P>Bulletins for 1985 Pontiac Fiero 4-151 2.5L<P>                                          Safety Recalls<P>     TSB Number   Issue Date  TSB Title<BR>  1. 88C23          JUN 90       Potential For Engine Fires <P>Safety Recalls<P>     TSB Number   Issue Date  TSB Title<BR>  1. 88C24          JUN 90       Potential For Engine Compartment Fires, Campaign 88-C-24 <P>Bulletins for 1986 Pontiac Fiero 4-151 2.5L<P>                                          Safety Recalls<P>     TSB Number   Issue Date  TSB Title<BR>  1. 88C23          JUN 90       Potential For Engine Fires <P>Safety Recalls<P>     TSB Number   Issue Date  TSB Title<BR>  1. 88C24          JUN 90       Potential For Engine Compartment Fires, Campaign 88-C-24<P>Bulletins for 1987 Pontiac Fiero 4-151 2.5L<P>                                          Safety Recalls<P>     TSB Number   Issue Date  TSB Title<BR>  1. 88C23          JUN 90       Potential For Engine Fires<P>Bulletins for 1987 Pontiac Fiero V6-173 2.8L<P>                                          Safety Recalls<P>     TSB Number   Issue Date  TSB Title<BR>  1. 88C24          JUN 90       Potential For Engine Compartment Fires, Campaign 88-C-24 <P>Bulletins for 1988 Pontiac Fiero 4-151 2.5L<P>                                          Safety Recalls<P>     TSB Number   Issue Date  TSB Title<BR>  1. 88C23          JUN 90       Potential For Engine Fires <P>Bulletins for 1988 Pontiac Fiero V6-173 2.8L<P>                    