Z||000057||PearlBlueSoul||11-29-2000||12:00 AM||||1FST2M6, the pics DON'T DO YOUR CAR JUSTICE!  I need to get ahold of a camera and shoot your car professionally.  <P>I had the esteemed pleasure of riding in this guy's car, and lemme tell ya, it's somethign else.  Very clean, well done, and he's still not done with it yet!  Man...great car.  Wish I could see it in daylight.  <P>I will more than definatley take you up on the GZE motor you've got, that and the SC14 upgrade.  After that I've got in mind to get a special pulley and some other stuff.  This is a very cool thing.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>Very nice fiero.  <P>------------------<BR>1987 Toyota MR2 N/A 5 speed<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.atlantamr2s.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.atlantamr2s.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/darionscard</A>  <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard/Thumb.jpg">       <BR><B>Notable mods:</B>  Sus tech springs and sway bars, Toyota strut tower brace, KYB strut inserts, HKS exhaust, NGK plugs/wires, Momo Racer wheels (14x6), Custom intake, Kenwood 12" speaker in front trunk, Jensen amp.||||reg||1
